      <div type="clause" n="15.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 15.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ write man manega gewrita be ðisum ⁊ sende ægðer ge to Ælfere ealdormen ge to Æþelwine ealdormen, ⁊ hi gehwyder, þæt ðes ræd cuð sy ægðer ge earmum ge eadigum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And many copies of this order shall be made and sent to both ealdormen, Aelfhere and Aethelwine, and they shall distribute them in all directions, so that this measure shall be known both to rich and poor.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ write man manega gewrita be þisum ⁊ sende ægþer ge to Ælfhere ealdormen ge to Æþelwine ealdormen, ⁊ hy gehwider, þæt þes ræd cuð sy ægþer ge earmum ge eadigum.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
